info_pages = PackedStringArray("Mike:\nMom, don't worry about the treatment costs.\nI've got it covered.", "Mary:\nYou always say that.\nI'm more worried about you.\nYou've been working too much lately. Make sure you're taking care of yourself too.", "Mike:\nI'm fine, Mom.\nDon't worry about me. Just focus on getting better.\n\nMike:\nI know you're trying to help.\nBut I'm okay. I don't want you wearing yourself out because of me.")
